        "payload": "tree e587140625517f421649e286ba0cc14f462edf81\nparent 0f27bed5b2924420d65caeca439e6b036d3c6cb2\nauthor optout21 <13562139+optout21@users.noreply.github.com> 1793261959 +0100\ncommitter optout21 <13562139+optout21@users.noreply.github.com> 1793778850 +0100\n\nDONTMERGE! net: Reproducer with forced chunked recv\n\nA stress test reproducer. For every socket read, read data in smaller\nrecv() calls.\nInstead of a performing a revc for up to the available buffer size normally,\ndo separate recv()'s for each byte, in order to stress test code paths.\nIf there is a large amount of data available (more than 200 bytes),\nuse a larger chunk size (113, not to slow down too much).\nWARNING: Only for testing purposes, not to be merged!\n",
